# 4.2 — tài khoản và đặc quyền: 4720/4722/4724/4725/4726/4728/4732/4733/4738/4672 trên log Security mẫu công khai.
# tc/hidden-user-4720.evtx: EVTX-to-MITRE-Attack "Hidden user creation" (công cụ CreateHiddenAccount, 2022) · 2-system-Security-dirty.evtx: Windows 10 thật (lúc cài đặt + lúc dùng).
@ps evtx-rec tc/hidden-user-4720.evtx | ConvertFrom-Json | Where-Object id -ne 4656 | ForEach-Object { '{0}  {1}  {2}' -f $_.t.ToString('HH:mm:ss.fff'), $_.id, (@($_.data.TargetUserName, $_.data.MemberSid, $_.data.CommandLine) | Where-Object { $_ -and $_ -ne '-' } | Select-Object -First 1) }
@ps evtx-rec tc/hidden-user-4720.evtx | ConvertFrom-Json | Where-Object id -in 4720,4738 | ForEach-Object { [pscustomobject]@{ Id = $_.id; User = $_.data.TargetUserName; OldUac = $_.data.OldUacValue; NewUac = $_.data.NewUacValue; Flags = ($_.data.UserAccountControl -replace '\s+',' ').Trim() } } | Format-Table -AutoSize
@ps evtx-rec tc/pwnever-4738.evtx | ConvertFrom-Json | ForEach-Object { [pscustomobject]@{ Luc = $_.t.ToString('s'); Ai = $_.data.SubjectUserName; User = $_.data.TargetUserName; OldUac = $_.data.OldUacValue; NewUac = $_.data.NewUacValue; Flags = ($_.data.UserAccountControl -replace '\s+',' ').Trim() } } | Format-Table -AutoSize
@ps evtx-rec tc/user-4720-4726.evtx | ConvertFrom-Json | ForEach-Object { [pscustomobject]@{ Luc = $_.t.ToString('s'); Id = $_.id; Ai = $_.data.SubjectUserName; User = $_.data.TargetUserName } } | Format-Table -AutoSize
@ps evtx-rec tc/admin-4732.evtx | ConvertFrom-Json | ForEach-Object { [pscustomobject]@{ Luc = $_.t.ToString('s'); Ai = $_.data.SubjectUserName; Nhom = $_.data.TargetUserName; Ai_Duoc_Them = $_.data.MemberSid } } | Format-Table -AutoSize
!evtx-rec mau/2-system-Security-dirty.evtx 2>/dev/null > /lab/ra/d.jsonl
@ps Get-Content /lab/ra/d.jsonl | ConvertFrom-Json | Where-Object id -in 4720,4722,4724,4725,4726,4731,4732,4738,4781 | Group-Object { $_.t.ToString('yyyy-MM-dd') } | Select-Object Count,@{n='Ngay';e={$_.Name}},@{n='CacId';e={ ($_.Group.id | Sort-Object -Unique) -join ',' }} | Format-Table -AutoSize
@ps Get-Content /lab/ra/d.jsonl | ConvertFrom-Json | Where-Object { $_.id -in 4720,4722,4725,4732 -and $_.t -lt [datetime]'2018-07-29' } | Select-Object -First 9 | ForEach-Object { '{0}  {1}  {2,-18} {3}' -f $_.t.ToString('HH:mm:ss'), $_.id, $_.data.SubjectUserName, $_.data.TargetUserName }
@ps Get-Content /lab/ra/d.jsonl | ConvertFrom-Json | Where-Object id -eq 4672 | Group-Object { $_.data.SubjectUserName } | Sort-Object Count -Descending | Select-Object -First 6 Count,Name | Format-Table -AutoSize
@ps Get-Content /lab/ra/d.jsonl | ConvertFrom-Json | Where-Object { $_.id -eq 4672 -and $_.data.SubjectUserName -eq 'Administrator' } | Select-Object -First 1 | ForEach-Object { $_.data.PrivilegeList -split '\s+' | Where-Object { $_ } }
# 4740 (khoá tài khoản) và 4767 (mở khoá) KHÔNG có trong bộ mẫu công khai nào ở đây — đếm thật để thấy:
evtx-rec mau/*.evtx tc/*.evtx 2>/dev/null | jq -r 'select(.id==4740 or .id==4767) | .id' | wc -l
